@Payment_HostAddress = https://localhost:7093

### Create a VNPAY payment url for an invoice
POST {{Payment_HostAddress}}/api/payment/create-url
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invoiceId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "accountId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "amount": 100000,
  "description": "Thanh toan hoa don thang 10",
  "bankCode": "ANY",
  "language": "Vietnamese"
}

### Effective payment status of an invoice (entry point for other services)
GET {{Payment_HostAddress}}/api/payment/by-invoice/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/status
Accept: application/json

### All attempts for an invoice
GET {{Payment_HostAddress}}/api/payment/by-invoice/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Transaction by VNPAY transaction reference
GET {{Payment_HostAddress}}/api/payment/by-txn-ref/638000000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Transactions of an account (paged)
GET {{Payment_HostAddress}}/api/payment/by-account/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000?pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### Transactions by status (paged)
GET {{Payment_HostAddress}}/api/payment/status/Succeeded?pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### VNPAY IPN - called by VNPAY, not by hand. Kept here for reference only.
GET {{Payment_HostAddress}}/api/payment/ipn?vnp_TxnRef=638000000000000000&vnp_Amount=10000000&vnp_ResponseCode=00&vnp_TransactionStatus=00&vnp_SecureHash=invalid
Accept: application/json
